   "text": "Let's take stock. Least squares is a projection, and among linear unbiased estimates the best. Ridge shrinks the weak directions; the lasso's soft thresholds choose words. Logistic regression is a convex bowl, and Newton's method finds its bottom in a few steps. Naive Bayes learns fast but stays wrong, and overconfident on these pages. In the large-sample limit, a single neighbour errs at most twice as often as the best rule, but neighbours drown in many dimensions. Kernels lift without lifting, and the support vector machine's dual needs only them. Averaging trees cuts variance down to a floor set by their correlation; boosting walks down the exponential loss, and XGBoost takes Newton steps. And an honest score needs the right curve and untouched test pages.",
   "raw": "Let's take stock. Least squares is a projection, and among linear unbiased estimates the best. Ridge shrinks the weak directions; the lasso's soft thresholds choose words. Logistic regression is a convex bowl, and Newton's method finds its bottom in a few steps. Naive Bayes learns fast but stays wrong, and overconfident on these pages. In the large-sample limit, a single neighbour errs at most twice as often as the best rule, but neighbours drown in many dimensions. Kernels lift without lifting, and the support vector machine's dual needs only them. Averaging trees cuts variance down to a floor set by their correlation; boosting walks down the exponential loss, and XGBoost takes Newton steps. And an honest score needs the right curve and untouched test pages.",
